    extensible to more platforms later)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ASSISTANT:
- New table `url_platform_targets` (url_id, platform, target_url; cascade
  delete; platform is a free string, not an enum, for future extensibility).
- CreateUrlRequest/UpdateUrlRequest gained optional `platformTargets`;
  UrlResponse returns them. Redirect endpoint now detects Android/iOS from
  User-Agent and picks the matching target, falling back to the default URL
  for desktop/unrecognized agents.
- Frontend: ModeTabs + PlatformFields components; create form and each link's
  edit view can switch between the two modes; switching to "single" and
  saving clears any platform targets.
- Verified via curl (all UA/platform combinations) and in-browser.

