ASSISTANT:
- Added `urls.view_count` and `url_platform_targets.click_count` columns
  (migrated via ALTER TABLE ... ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS).
- GetRedirectTarget now calls repository.RecordVisit(id, matchedPlatform) —
  always bumps total view_count, and only bumps a platform's click_count
  when that platform's override was actually used (not on fallback).
